00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:14,360
(11:50-12:00 PM)

2
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:19,400
(11:50-12:00 PM)

3
00:00:20,653 --> 00:00:23,760
♪Your silhouette melts into the glow♪

4
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,680
(Congrats to our grand prize winner!
Prize money: 100,000 yuan)

5
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:30,872
♪I count your sighs♪

6
00:00:32,482 --> 00:00:34,680
♪Every breath♪

7
00:00:34,804 --> 00:00:37,560
♪Feels like I'm stealing♪

8
00:00:39,630 --> 00:00:41,157
♪The next second♪

9
00:00:41,604 --> 00:00:44,357
♪Before it's no longer mine♪

10
00:00:48,023 --> 00:00:50,628
♪We live♪
(Capernaum)

11
00:00:50,628 --> 00:00:54,277
♪In the spaces between moments♪

12
00:00:56,210 --> 00:01:00,840
♪Breathing through each other's shadows♪

13
00:01:02,243 --> 00:01:05,000
♪Let's not speak of what's to come♪

14
00:01:05,317 --> 00:01:08,177
♪Or what came before♪

15
00:01:09,769 --> 00:01:14,589
♪This moment could last me a lifetime♪
(12:00-11:50 PM)

16
00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:21,000
=Thirteen Types of Love=
=Episode 9=

17
00:01:21,336 --> 00:01:24,960
(An hour ago)

18
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:34,880
Freeze.

19
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:51,840
Freeze!

20
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:21,040
Stop wasting your energy.

21
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,560
Or you'll all die here.

22
00:02:31,720 --> 00:02:32,440
Stop wasting your energy.

23
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:34,520
Or you'll all die here.

24
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:37,680
Hurry up!

25
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,040
Enough!

26
00:02:47,640 --> 00:02:48,320
You're ganging up on me.

27
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,280
Go easy on me.

28
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:36,400
Last run,

29
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:38,080
this is as far as I got.

30
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:40,080
Bring it on.

31
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:45,920
You guys

32
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:48,320
are brutal.

33
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:01,600
Give up.

34
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:04,280
I'm omniscient and omnipotent.

35
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:07,240
Even if you finally manage
to finish your mission,

36
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:09,200
you'll just end up
with your brain scooped out.

37
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:12,240
Who are you, really?

38
00:04:16,840 --> 00:04:18,400
I'm your god.

39
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:20,160
Worship me,

40
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:21,600
and I'll let you live.

41
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:25,880
What keeps me alive

42
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:27,240
isn't avoiding danger.

43
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:30,520
It's the pills
the organization gives me every month.

44
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:37,200
Like what Tianshan Tonglao does?
[*Wuxia master who rations antidotes]

45
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:40,880
Pretty much.

46
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:43,440
If we miss a mission deadline

47
00:04:43,440 --> 00:04:44,760
or fail to report on time,

48
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:45,720
they cut us off.

49
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:46,920
Then

50
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:48,800
your mind starts to slow down.

51
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:50,000
You start talking nonsense.

52
00:04:50,200 --> 00:04:51,000
Eventually, you go mad.

53
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:51,760
And then

54
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:55,760
your brain shrinks.

55
00:04:58,640 --> 00:04:59,840
Thanks for telling me

56
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:03,000
how exactly Duo dies

57
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:05,440
in this universe.

58
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,600
Well...

59
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:13,240
I know everything now.

60
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:19,480
I can save you.

61
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:24,040
The catch is still that
I have to fall for you first?

62
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:29,480
Could this premise

63
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:31,000
be any more melodramatic?

64
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,320
Want to hear

65
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,840
my plan first?

66
00:05:51,400 --> 00:05:52,880
Su Yu already told me.

67
00:05:54,200 --> 00:05:54,760
Who?

68
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:56,840
In this universe,

69
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:57,960
she goes by Spider Lily.

70
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:00,440
Equinox.

71
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:01,480
Okay.

72
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:02,760
Then Equinox it is.

73
00:06:03,320 --> 00:06:04,080
She's arranged for the elders

74
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:06,160
to enter the underground safe house
ahead of time.

75
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:07,080
The way it's built,

76
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:08,560
once the safe house
is locked from the inside,

77
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:10,120
you can't open it from the outside.

78
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:10,720
So,

79
00:06:10,880 --> 00:06:12,080
before they get inside,

80
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,480
we have to take them captive,

81
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:15,000
find out what's in your pills,

82
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:15,720
and get you an antidote.

83
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:16,280
Or we can...

84
00:06:16,400 --> 00:06:16,840
Get in first.

85
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:18,480
Right.

86
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:21,200
We find a way to get inside

87
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:22,440
before the elders do.

88
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:24,280
That keeps casualties to a minimum.

89
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:25,240
It's the safest option.

90
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:26,640
Then let's do that.

91
00:06:27,640 --> 00:06:28,840
I'll draw the guards away.

92
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:31,880
Then what?

93
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:32,960
We go in.

94
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:34,560
The door's locked.

95
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,960
It takes an iris scan to open it.

96
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:37,240
How are we supposed to get in
without access?

97
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:43,320
My iris scan

98
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,320
opens the door.

99
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:47,520
- What did you say?
- How's that possible?

100
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:50,360
I-I was curious, so I tried it.

101
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,320
It just opened.

102
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:53,000
Weird. Why would it open?

103
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:03,000
I'm finding it really hard
to believe you.

104
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:05,000
But everything he's saying is true.

105
00:07:28,960 --> 00:07:29,440
This video

106
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:30,480
could've been made with AI.

107
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,320
But AI

108
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:34,280
has never seen this place,

109
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:35,880
let alone

110
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:37,040
An Zu

111
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:39,400
or Camellia.

112
00:07:41,520 --> 00:07:42,400
Camellia

113
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:45,760
isn't dead?

114
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:49,040
And An Zu

115
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:51,360
was right there with her.

116
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:53,880
They're clearly working together,

117
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:56,480
yet they sent us to wipe each other out.

118
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:00,920
So we're the pawns.

119
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:03,680
How did you get this video?

120
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:10,360
I risked my life to get it.

121
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:13,720
I don't know how he did it,

122
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,160
but I believe him.

123
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:19,280
Duo,

124
00:08:20,440 --> 00:08:22,040
I swear I've never lied to you.

125
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:25,040
I just can't explain it right now.

126
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,000
You say you love me,

127
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:36,080
so I know you'd never risk my life.

128
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:39,880
We'll do it your way.

129
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:45,200
Okay.

130
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:03,040
Guards are about to pass

131
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:04,760
at our seven o'clock and three o'clock.

132
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:05,480
Five.

133
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:06,320
Four.

134
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:07,120
Three.

135
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:07,840
Two.

136
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:08,440
One.

137
00:09:08,880 --> 00:09:09,360
Shift change.

138
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:44,320
Two guards will pass in seven seconds.

139
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:46,000
If we hide,

140
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,400
we can avoid them completely.

141
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:48,760
Five.

142
00:09:49,400 --> 00:09:49,920
Four.

143
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:51,040
Three.

144
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:52,160
Two.

145
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:53,600
Now.

146
00:11:16,880 --> 00:11:17,800
(Authentication successful.)

147
00:12:26,640 --> 00:12:28,540
(Fire Hydrant)

148
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:39,920
(Authentication...)

149
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:44,720
(Successful.)

150
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:42,480
It worked.

151
00:13:51,040 --> 00:13:52,560
What's going on?

152
00:14:10,680 --> 00:14:11,160
Who...

153
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:12,800
are you?

154
00:14:13,560 --> 00:14:14,080
Yongsen,

155
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,760
you'd better
get Night Owl out here. Now.

156
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:18,000
Otherwise,

157
00:14:18,400 --> 00:14:19,720
we're all going to die here.

158
00:14:20,560 --> 00:14:21,400
What does that mean?

159
00:14:24,560 --> 00:14:25,320
Explaining

160
00:14:25,600 --> 00:14:27,600
would take longer than
it'd take him to turn you into sashimi.

161
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:29,200
Got it.

162
00:15:59,240 --> 00:15:59,920
What are you staring at?

163
00:16:01,400 --> 00:16:02,160
Get out of here.

164
00:16:05,680 --> 00:16:06,880
I don't think I can leave.

165
00:16:08,360 --> 00:16:09,760
Only in real danger

166
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:12,880
will his original consciousness
take over to protect his body.

167
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:15,000
He can protect you, too.

168
00:16:18,160 --> 00:16:19,160
Don't worry, Duo.

169
00:16:26,400 --> 00:16:27,120
Go on, choke me to death.

170
00:16:32,520 --> 00:16:33,240
Yongsen!

171
00:17:10,017 --> 00:17:13,547
♪Does fate write every hello♪

172
00:17:13,577 --> 00:17:15,557
♪With a goodbye in mind?♪

173
00:17:21,497 --> 00:17:24,977
♪Does longing give us a beginning♪

174
00:17:25,097 --> 00:17:27,027
♪And leave us without an ending?♪

175
00:17:33,077 --> 00:17:37,817
♪I remember the way you breathe♪

176
00:17:39,087 --> 00:17:41,867
♪Countless versions of me♪

177
00:17:42,647 --> 00:17:48,267
♪All point in the same direction♪

178
00:17:48,767 --> 00:17:51,827
♪Toward you♪

179
00:17:53,997 --> 00:17:55,627
♪I'll find you♪

180
00:17:55,967 --> 00:17:58,907
♪In the silence as the world is reborn♪

181
00:17:59,387 --> 00:18:01,287
♪I'll find you♪

182
00:18:01,607 --> 00:18:04,507
♪In the instant
before anything is decided♪

183
00:18:05,067 --> 00:18:06,827
♪I'll find you♪

184
00:18:07,427 --> 00:18:10,227
♪In the gaps
where time overlaps and slips♪

185
00:18:10,837 --> 00:18:12,597
♪I'll find you♪

186
00:18:16,927 --> 00:18:18,627
♪I'll find you♪

187
00:18:18,747 --> 00:18:21,787
♪In the promises left unsaid♪

188
00:18:22,237 --> 00:18:23,837
♪I'll find you♪

189
00:18:24,407 --> 00:18:27,147
♪In every pause between heartbeats♪

190
00:18:27,867 --> 00:18:29,787
♪I'll find you♪

191
00:18:30,317 --> 00:18:33,067
♪Where the last faint light fades♪

192
00:18:33,667 --> 00:18:35,477
♪I'll find you♪

193
00:18:39,387 --> 00:18:44,747
♪I'll find you♪
